Sync digest

From <%= l(@digest.from, format: :short) %> to <%= l(@digest.to, format: :short) %>: <%= @digest.summary %>.
<% if (share = @digest.ga_share) %>
GA saw <%= number_to_percentage(share.last_week * 100, precision: 0) %> of our views last week (usual <%= number_to_percentage(share.usual * 100, precision: 0) %>).
<% end %>
<% if @digest.counts.any? %>
<%= @digest.counts.map { |status, count| "#{count} #{sync_status_label(status).downcase}" }.join(" · ") %>
<% end %>
<% if @digest.needs_a_look? %>

Needs a look
<% if @digest.missing_snapshot %>

- Consent snapshots: Missing
  None was stored for <%= l(@digest.missing_snapshot) %>, so the consent flags can't judge that day. Run bin/rails consent:snapshot.
<% end %>
<% if (ai = @digest.stale_ai_upload) %>

- Generative AI upload: Out of date
  The <%= ai.search_type %> figures stop at <%= l(ai.last_day) %>. Export Search Console's Generative AI report again and upload it on the Generative AI page.
<% end %>
<% @digest.problems.each do |request| %>

- <%= request.section %>: <%= sync_status_label(request.display_status) %>
  <%= request.source %> · <%= request.trigger_label %> · started <%= l(request.created_at, format: :short) %>
<% request.error_messages.first(SyncDigest::ERRORS_SHOWN).each do |error| %>
  <%= error %>
<% end %>
<% if (more = request.error_count - SyncDigest::ERRORS_SHOWN).positive? %>
  and <%= pluralize(more, "more error") %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

Last successful sync
<% @digest.freshness.each do |kind, (completed, _latest)| %>
- <%= SyncRequest::KINDS.fetch(kind).section %>: <%= completed ? "#{time_ago_in_words(completed.finished_at)} ago" : "never" %>
<% end %>
